{{!-- Token art toggle: a corner icon on the portrait that sets how this actor's
     tokens draw its art — the circular bust the system crops from the portrait
     (fa-circle-user), or the whole image (fa-image). It matches the portrait's
     other corner controls (origin builder, generate, re-roll/pin): a bare gold
     icon, brighter while the whole art is on. The including template places it
     in the portrait's top-right corner, so the click never reaches the
     portrait's editImage.

     Context: `portraitTokenArt` = { full } | null, set for every actor sheet by
     BaseActorSheet._prepareCommonContext; null for a viewer who does not own
     the actor, so only an owner sees the control.

     A native <button role="switch">: keyboard-focusable, Enter / Space toggle
     it, and `aria-checked` is true when the token shows the whole art. --}}
{{#if portraitTokenArt}}
<button type="button"
        role="switch"
        aria-checked="{{#if portraitTokenArt.full}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}"
        class="tw-m-0 tw-flex tw-h-auto tw-min-h-0 tw-w-auto tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-border-0 tw-bg-transparent tw-p-0 tw-shadow-none tw-text-lg tw-leading-none tw-cursor-pointer tw-transition-all hover:tw-bg-transparent hover:tw-text-[#f0d060] hover:tw-opacity-100 hover:tw-drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(212,175,55,0.9)] focus-visible:tw-opacity-100 focus-visible:tw-outline focus-visible:tw-outline-2 focus-visible:tw-outline-[#f0d060] {{#if portraitTokenArt.full}}tw-text-[#f0d060] tw-opacity-100{{else}}tw-text-gold {{themeClassFor 'accent'}} tw-opacity-60{{/if}}"
        data-action="toggleTokenArt"
        data-tooltip="{{#if portraitTokenArt.full}}{{localize 'WH40K.Portrait.TokenArt.Full'}}{{else}}{{localize 'WH40K.Portrait.TokenArt.Bust'}}{{/if}}"
        aria-label="{{localize 'WH40K.Portrait.TokenArt.Label'}}">
    <i class="fa-solid {{#if portraitTokenArt.full}}fa-image{{else}}fa-circle-user{{/if}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</button>
{{/if}}
